<title>POLAND: KROSNO NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>KROSNO NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.97 vs   0.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.60 vs   0.93</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.76 vs   0.92</p>
<p> Sales		   14.48 vs  15.43</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.06 vs   8.00</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	14.00 vs  12.96</p>
<p> Operating profit    15.03 vs  15.10</p>
<p> Sales		  165.28 vs 141.11</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glass maker is Krosnienskie Huty</p>
<p>Szkla Krosno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
